/Title (A Thousand Women Africa is a women-led organisation committed to advancing education, empowerment, and advocacy for women and girls across Africa. Through research, community programmes, policy engagement, and innovative solutions such as the End Period Poverty Project and Luwa \(menstrual equity platform\), the organisation works to ensure that every woman and girl can thrive with dignity, opportunity, and equitable access to essential resources.)
